## 6. State management strategy

- **Server state:** TanStack Query only — keys from `query/keys.ts`, stale times from `query/staleTimes.ts`.
- **UI navigation:** `uiStore` — overlay open, ball vs Pokémon panel, ids.
- **Discovery UI:** `discoveryUiStore` — panel open, tab, filters, query, list highlight index.
- **Compare slots:** `comparisonStore` — open state, A/B ids, swap.
- **Dex lists:** `dexListsStore` — favorites + recents persistence (local patterns as implemented).
- **Team Builder UI:** `teamBuilderStore` — modal open/close + up to six locked species ids (session-oriented; not persisted unless changed later).

Avoid duplicating Query cache into Zustand.

---

## 7. API / data-fetching strategy

- Typed `PokeApiError`; retry policy in `createQueryClient.ts` (no retry loop on 404).
- Heavy reads batched in **service** modules under `services/pokeapi/`.
- **`PokemonSummary`** always includes **`baseStats`** from `mapPokemonSummary` so consumers (My Dex grids, Team Builder) share one shape.
- **`qk.pokemon.detailExtras`** returns type matchups plus **evolution `chain`** and enriched **`timelineStages`** (species flavor + trigger summaries) in one fetch cycle—avoid parallel duplicate chain fetches.
- Prefetch on meaningful hover / open transitions (`query/prefetch.ts`).

---

## 8. Animation philosophy

- Motion for **overlay enter/exit** and **sheet** modals; springs disabled or shortened when reduced motion.
- CSS tokens for micro-interactions on controls.
- No competing animation systems.

---

## 9. Accessibility requirements

- Focus trap + restoration in modal/drawer; keyboard carousel; listbox keyboard + shortcuts documented.
- ARIA for icon-only controls; live regions for status where appropriate.
- Touch targets ≥ ~44px for critical actions.

---

## 10. Performance requirements

- Lazy images where sensible; prefetch predictable next queries.
- No unbounded client work on main thread during scroll without profiling.

---

## 11. Coding conventions

- Match existing file style; minimal diffs; no drive-by renames.
- Reuse hooks/utilities before inventing parallel patterns.
- English UI copy; complete sentences in user-facing errors.

---

## 12. Design system conventions

- `src/styles/design-tokens.css` + Tailwind arbitrary `var(--*)` usage.
- `.app-focus-ring`, `.app-surface-glass` in `index.css`.
- Type atmosphere via `html[data-atmosphere]` set by `AppAtmosphere.tsx`.

---

## 13. Naming conventions

- Components: `PascalCase.tsx`.
- Hooks: `useThing.ts`.
- Stores: `*Store.ts` with `useThingStore`.
- Query keys: `qk` object factories.

---

## 14. Constraints & anti-patterns

- Do not add flaky or heavy global state debuggers in production paths.
- Do not replace Query with ad hoc fetch in components for shared data.
- Do not stack redundant glow/filter effects on top of token shadows.
- Do not bypass accessibility for “faster” UI experiments.

